    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/7dd018e3-e0ce-44c3-84b3-ee16a080bfd3-01/ReviewTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AppealTerms1>;
  dct:description """The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. 
The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. 
The effusive Maxim rules the craft of violin making with an iron fist, together with his best friend Stefan, a very lonely and introverted man, but an authority on violin repair. One day Maxim falls deeply in love with a violinist, Camille. And while they are about to move in together, Stefan comes out of his shell and decides to claim the beautiful woman, much to his friend's dismay. 
vol3"""@en;
